{"title":"Icebound Mate","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 55 Icebound that attacks with slash (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around -116, -1004</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>1</td><td>in the wilds around -118, -1001</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>5</td><td>in the wilds around -122, -1036</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"icebound-mate\" data-map-level=\"57\">Show level 57 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1254.6px,792.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/4/-4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/4/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/5/-4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:-1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/5/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:-768px\"><i style=\"left:1240.4px;top:-790.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1235.8px;top:-779.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1215.4px;top:-769.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1410.3px;top:-784.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1326.9px;top:-831.9px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -121, -1033 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -58, -1084 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"icebound-mate\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Icebound: <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand\">Icebound Deckhand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner\">Icebound Harpooner</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-captain\">Drowned Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\">